{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡流傳一段影片，顯示在屯門柏麗廣場內，一名身穿小學校服的男童，用白繩綁着一隻雀鳥，先後將雀鳥高高吊起及在地上拖行。片中所見，該隻雀鳥被拖行後已完全失去反應，男童隨後坐下察看，影片隨即結束。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-02-10h43m14s138.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20269b4Z71spY91790910624.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-02-10h43m14s138.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">影片引發網民群情洶湧，發帖者指責當時家長竟在旁邊目擊而未有制止：「乜嘢事，雀仔唔係拎嚟玩，個家長就喺隔籬望住個細路玩雀仔….細佬冇品家長都冇X品，唔識教就唔好生啦，CXs」。亦有網民憑校服認出涉事男童為區內一間小學的學生，表明已主動向校方發信投訴。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-02-10h43m19s800.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026K4A3G0f2941790910634.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-02-10h43m19s800.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p3\" style=\"text-align: left;\">警方表示於昨日（10月1日）上午8時45分接獲市民報案，指網上有片段顯示有人在柏麗廣場一商場疑不恰當對待雀鳥。警員到場搜查後未有發現受傷動物。案件經調查後被列為「殘酷對待動物」，現正交由屯門警區刑事調查隊第三隊跟進，暫時未有人被捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T04:39:05.895792+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":337,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}